            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe lacedon devours a chunk of the corpse and regains 2d6 Hit Points. It can regain Hit Points from any given corpse only once.\n\nGhoul Fever; (disease); DC 16 Fortitude; Stage 1: carrier with no ill effect (1 day); Stage 2: 2d6 negative damage and regains half as many Hit Points from all healing (1 day); Stage 3: as stage 2 (1 day); Stage 4: 2d6 negative damage and gains no benefit from healing (1 day); Stage 5: as stage 4 (1 day); Stage 6: dead and rises as a ghoul the next midnight Paralyzing Spew 1 (incapacitation, occult, necromancy)"
